\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces Comparison of the sand reflectance metrics between El Puntal and Salinas. The left panel displays the absolute albedo proxy ($\bar  {\rho }_{RGB}$), while the right panel highlights the colorimetric slope ($\Delta _{R-B}$). Boxplots represent the interquartile range and median, with overlaid stripplots detailing individual scene observations.}}{46}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:reflectance_boxplots}{{4.1}{46}{}{figure.4.1}{}}
